OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786927673
OL,3,CMan proposes to partner after walking
OL,4,C96 miles in 36 hours in memory of her
OL,5,Cson
OL,7,FA Scottish man rounded off a 96-mile
OL,8,Fcharity challenge in honour of his
OL,9,Fpartner and her late son by proposing
OL,10,Fto her at the finish line.
OL,12,FBenjamin Ward, 44, from Falkirk, said
OL,13,Fthey were his "sole focus" as he
OL,14,Fcompleted the West Highland Way, a
OL,15,Flong distance hiking trail, in 36
OL,16,Fhours and 48 minutes.
OL,26,@uD@OOUuD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786927673
OL,3,CMan proposes to partner after walking
OL,4,C96 miles in 36 hours in memory of her
OL,5,Cson
OL,7,FWhen he crossed the finish line in
OL,8,FFort William last Sunday, he got down
OL,9,Fon one knee and asked partner Natasha
OL,10,FGoldthorpe, 37, from Irvine, to marry
OL,11,Fhim.
OL,13,FHe told the Press Association: "I
OL,14,Fdon't think it's quite sunk in what I
OL,15,Fmanaged to do, because I was so just
OL,16,Ffocused on trying to do it for Natasha
OL,17,Fand Liam ` that was really my sole
OL,18,Ffocus in it."
OL,26,@uD@`OUzD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786927673
OL,3,CMan proposes to partner after walking
OL,4,C96 miles in 36 hours in memory of her
OL,5,Cson
OL,7,FMs Goldthorpe's son Liam had a rare
OL,8,Fand progressive condition called BPAN,
OL,9,Fa disorder that damages the nervous
OL,10,Fsystem and gradually gets worse.
OL,12,FHe died last October aged 13.
OL,14,FIn memory of Liam, Mr Ward, a manager
OL,15,Fat a tiling company in Irvine, decided
OL,16,Fto walk the 96-mile route in one
OL,17,Fcontinuous push to raise money for one
OL,18,Fof the charities that helped the
OL,19,Fteenager's family.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786927673
OL,3,CMan proposes to partner after walking
OL,4,C96 miles in 36 hours in memory of her
OL,5,Cson
OL,7,FMs Goldthorpe said: "Liam had a
OL,8,Fprogressive condition, but he was
OL,9,Falways happy and smiley.
OL,11,F"He had a really contagious smile. He
OL,12,Fwas giggly. He'd find noises really
OL,13,Ffunny. He was just such a gorgeous
OL,14,Fboy."
OL,16,FMr Ward said in the time he shared
OL,17,Fwith Liam, he witnessed incredible
OL,18,Fstrength both from the youngster and
OL,19,Fhis mother.
OL,26,@oD@UOUsD@AOUvD@EO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786927673
OL,3,CMan proposes to partner after walking
OL,4,C96 miles in 36 hours in memory of her
OL,5,Cson
OL,7,F"I got to know Natasha and I was very
OL,8,Fmuch blown away by the care and love
OL,9,Fand relationship between her and
OL,10,FLiam," he said.
OL,12,FLast August, he took on his first West
OL,13,FHighland Way challenge in honour of
OL,14,FLiam, walking the trail in two-and-a-
OL,15,Fhalf days to raise money for
OL,16,FChildren's Hospices Across Scotland,
OL,17,Fanother charity that supported the
OL,18,Ffamily.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786927673
OL,3,CMan proposes to partner after walking
OL,4,C96 miles in 36 hours in memory of her
OL,5,Cson
OL,7,FAt the end of that challenge, Ms
OL,8,FGoldthorpe confessed her feelings for
OL,9,FMr Ward. Since then, he said the trail
OL,10,Fhas felt like a special place for them
OL,11,Fboth.
OL,13,FHe said that is why proposing in Fort
OL,14,FWilliam a year later at the end of his
OL,15,Flatest challenge felt right.
OL,17,FMs Goldthorpe said it was "great" to
OL,18,Fsee him jog across the finish line and
OL,19,Fget down on one knee, but she could
OL,20,Fnot stop laughing.
OL,26,@yD@[OUyD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786927673
OL,3,CMan proposes to partner after walking
OL,4,C96 miles in 36 hours in memory of her
OL,5,Cson
OL,7,F"It was weird because he was running
OL,8,Fand smiling, and everybody who was
OL,9,Fsupporting him (for that last section)
OL,10,Flooked more miserable and more tired
OL,11,Fand more fed up than he was," she said.
OL,13,FOne of the biggest challenges Mr Ward
OL,14,Fexperienced along the way was the
OL,15,Fweather.
OL,17,FHe said he walked about 30 miles
OL,18,Fovernight and it "didn't stop raining
OL,19,Fonce".
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@PpmqD@fpnsD@]O]zD@ROU{D@EO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786927673
OL,3,CMan proposes to partner after walking
OL,4,C96 miles in 36 hours in memory of her
OL,5,Cson
OL,7,FHe recalled: "It was heavy rain and
OL,8,Fthe wind also picked up, so it was
OL,9,Fkind of driving rain into our face.
OL,11,F"I couldn't see probably more than
OL,12,Ffour feet in front of my face because
OL,13,Fit was just pitch black, and then the
OL,14,Frain was just making it even darker.
OL,16,F"The paths had turned to rivers at
OL,17,Fthat point because the rain had been
OL,18,Fso constant, so all the trails were
OL,19,Fjust full of water. My feet were just
OL,20,Fconsistently soaked pretty much the
OL,21,Fwhole night."
OL,26,@oD@NOUsD@AOUxD@AOU}D@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786927673
OL,3,CMan proposes to partner after walking
OL,4,C96 miles in 36 hours in memory of her
OL,5,Cson
OL,7,FDespite the poor conditions, Mr Ward
OL,8,Fsaid giving up "never" crossed his
OL,9,Fmind.
OL,11,F"They were my inspiration for doing
OL,12,Fit, Natasha and Liam have been
OL,13,Feverything, really," he said.
OL,15,F"I did actually enjoy it, which is a
OL,16,Fweird thing because I didn't expect to
OL,17,Fenjoy it. I thought by the finish line
OL,18,FI would be crawling."
OL,26,@pD@POUpD@VO]sD@AOUuD@TO]wD@AOUzD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786927673
OL,3,CMan proposes to partner after walking
OL,4,C96 miles in 36 hours in memory of her
OL,5,Cson
OL,7,FMr Ward's challenge has raised more
OL,8,Fthan #3,000 for Together for Short
OL,9,FLives, a leading UK-wide charity
OL,10,Fdedicated to supporting children and
OL,11,Fyoung people with life-limiting or
OL,12,Flife-threatening conditions and their
OL,13,Ffamilies.
OL,15,FThe charity created necklaces from
OL,16,FLiam's fingerprint for Ms Goldthorpe
OL,17,Fand her family following his death at
OL,18,Fno cost.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786927673
OL,3,CMan proposes to partner after walking
OL,4,C96 miles in 36 hours in memory of her
OL,5,Cson
OL,7,F"Having seen first-hand the impact
OL,8,F(Together for Short Lives) makes, I
OL,9,Fwanted to try and support their work
OL,10,Ffor other families faced with such
OL,11,Fdevastating events," Mr Ward said.
OL,13,FAlthough his challenge is complete, Mr
OL,14,FWard's JustGiving page is still
OL,15,Faccepting donations at justgiving.com/
OL,16,Fpage/benjamin-ward-1775733752801.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@ApmpD@ZpnsD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/11
